{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"98567","tmdb_id":"movie/98567","media_type":"movie","title":"十二生肖","original_title":"十二生肖","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0ZZyjVySzTK58NV8HdVyCQS4NM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKPRS8GmIxjV8obWbWC1WsNdUfr.jpg","overview":"当年英法联军火烧圆明园，致使大批珍贵文物流落海外，其中四尊十二生肖兽首最引人关注，不仅惹出国内外的广泛争论，更有收藏家开出天价竞拍这几尊珍品。当然，其间不乏奸邪的文物贩子，试图通过偷盗的手段获取宝贝。以此为契机，正在度假的国际大盗JC（成龙 饰）隆重登场。JC背后有一支 Simon（权相宇 饰）、David（廖凡 饰）、Bonnie（张蓝心 饰）等人共同组成的超专业团队，他们一同远赴巴黎，寻求国宝鉴定专家Coco（姚星彤 饰）的帮助。经过周密细致的准备，JC等人一步步逼近重兵把守的兽首，而围绕珍宝不可避免爆发连番惊险火爆的打斗与追逐。在这一过程中，JC似曾被利益和金钱泯灭的爱国之心渐渐苏醒。","release_date":"2012-12-20","first_air_date":"","year":"2012","runtime":"123","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":0,"number_of_seasons":0,"genres":["动作","冒险"],"languages":["普通话","English","Français","Español","Pусский"],"countries":["China","Hong Kong"],"tmdb_rating":"6.2 / 10 from 946 users","tmdb_rating_average":6.185,"tmdb_votes":946,"imdb_id":"tt1424310","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1424310/","imdb_rating":"6.0 / 10 from 26730 users","imdb_rating_average":"6.0","imdb_votes":"26730","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":18897,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"成龙","original_name":"成龍","popularity":9.2215,"profile_path":"/nraZoTzwJQPHspAVsKfgl3RXKKa.jpg","credit_id":"52fe4a199251416c750dda39","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":18897,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"成龙","original_name":"成龍","popularity":9.2215,"profile_path":"/nraZoTzwJQPHspAVsKfgl3RXKKa.jpg","credit_id":"52fe4a199251416c750dda45","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":46321,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"董韵诗","original_name":"董韻詩","popularity":0.2246,"profile_path":"/hYsmuPJT8tY9vgjMGZNd5MRwLnU.jpg","credit_id":"52fe4a199251416c750dda51","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":44916,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"唐季礼","original_name